SUMMARY:Fall Plant Sale and Market
DESCRIPTION:Fall Plant Sale and Market\nSeptember 25-26\, 2026\n10:00 a.m – 3:00 p.m.\nCalling all garden lovers! Join us on Friday and Saturday\, September 25 and 26 for our annual Fall Plant Sale and Market! The Market features unique plants grown in The North Carolina Arboretum’s Production Greenhouse and includes over 30 local growers and businesses. \nShop an outstanding collection of annuals\, perennials and crafts to the sounds of live music! \nJoin us on Friday and Saturday in the Education Center from 11:30 a.m. – 12:30 p.m.for a free adult education class. \nOn Saturday\, September 26 join us at The Kids Corner hosted by The Extension Master Gardeners of Buncombe County. \nThe Arboretum’s standard $25 parking fee applies for all non-members. Interested in joining as a member? Join today! \nVendors\nAppalachian DiviniTEA\nAsheville Blue Ridge Rose Society\nAw Shucks Gourmet Popcorn\nBear Necessities Farm\nBellyfull Plants Nursery\nBlazing Star Flowers**\nBlooms of Kindness\nBotanical Tortoise Co\nBridge & Tunnel Coffee Co.\nBuncombe County Extension Master Gardeners\nEchoes of the Forest\nFlower Moon Nursery\nHigh Country Nursery\nHomegrown Tropicals\nImladris Farm\nKindland Farms\nKW Edible Landscaping Nursery\nMak8ng stuff\nMilkweed Meadows Farm\nMossy Path Studio\nNature Creations Plaster Casting\nOpen Hearts Art Center\nReems Creek Nursery\nResin8light\nSaturnia Farm*\nShiny Hand Soap Co\nSkipping Pibble Designs\nSloth and Crow Wood Craft*\nSoil & Sun Studio\nSolstice Handmade\nTanager Plants\nThe Artful Plant\nThe Farm Connection\nThe Turquoise Tortuga\nWehrloom Honey*\nWell Seasoned Table\n\n* Friday only\n**Saturday only
URL:https://ncarboretum.org/event/fall-plant-sale-and-market-3-2/2026-09-26/
LOCATION:Arboretum Tent | Parking Bay #3
CATEGORIES:Events,Featured
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://ncarboretum.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Fall2026PlantSaleNewsletterImage_Fall_02132026.png
