SUMMARY:The Botanical Series: First Pour
DESCRIPTION:The Botanical Series: First Pour\n\n\n\n\nWednesday\, September 30\, 2026 from 6 to 9 p.m.\nAntidote at Chemist Spirits – 151 Coxe Ave\, Asheville\, NC 28801\n\n\n\n\nJoin us for the first taste of a collaboration rooted in Western North Carolina. \nThe North Carolina Arboretum and Chemist Spirits have come together to create a one-of-a-kind botanical vodka featuring botanicals harvested from the Arboretum and transformed by Chemist Spirits. Your ticket includes one specialty cocktail featuring the new botanical vodka\, along with light bites. Additional beverages will be available for purchase. \nWant a peek behind the scenes? A limited number of guests may add on a 5:00 p.m. tour of Chemist Spirits’ distillery before First Pour. A First Pour event ticket is required to participate in the tour. \nPlease note: This event is for guests ages 21 and older. A valid photo ID will be required for age verification upon arrival.\nLearn more and purchase tickets here.
URL:https://ncarboretum.org/event/the-botanical-series-first-pour/
LOCATION:Off Site Field Experience
CATEGORIES:Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ncarboretum.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/antidote.jpg
END:VEVENT
