SUMMARY:The Botanical Series: Roots and Spirits
DESCRIPTION:The Botanical Series: Roots and Spirits\nSaturday\, October 3\, 2026 from 5 to 7 p.m.\nHeritage Garden at The North Carolina Arboretum\n\n\n\n\nCome wander\, sip and celebrate the connection between plants\, craft and place!\n  \nAs part of Carolina Craft Day\, raise a glass where the story began. \nJoin us in the Heritage Garden at The North Carolina Arboretum for Roots & Spirits\, a relaxed evening celebrating our new botanical vodka collaboration with Chemist Spirits—and the plants\, people and craftsmanship that inspired it. \nEnjoy a specialty cocktail featuring the new botanical vodka while exploring the Heritage Garden and discovering more about this uniquely Western North Carolina collaboration. Along the way\, meet artists from Echoes of the Forest and watch traditional and contemporary woodworking demonstrations\, including spoon carving and laser wood engraving. \nYour ticket includes one specialty cocktail featuring the botanical vodka\, light bites and parking. Additional beverages will be available for purchase. \nPlease note: This event is for guests ages 21 and older. A valid photo ID will be required for age verification upon arrival. \n\n\nLearn more and purchase tickets here.
URL:https://ncarboretum.org/event/the-botanical-series-roots-and-spirits/
LOCATION:Arboretum Gardens
CATEGORIES:Events
